WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.842
1. Open the link in the email, or To approve on Home, and choose the contract.

2
00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:11.318
2. Check the details, then open the signed copy and check it matches.

3
00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:17.077
3. Something not right? Click Send back and say what needs fixing. It goes back to the owner.

4
00:00:17.077 --> 00:00:22.008
4. All good? Click Approve and register, then confirm. It becomes Effective and locked, and you're back on Home.

5
00:00:22.008 --> 00:00:27.655
5. Approved by mistake? Click Undo in the message, or Undo approval on the contract, within 24 hours.
